					 <div class='gwd'> <section class='final-cta'> <div class='bg-mesh'><div class='blob blob1'></div><div class='blob blob2'></div></div> <div class='wrap final-cta-in'> <span class='kicker' style='color:var(--lime)'>Free Dubai marketing audit</span> <h2 style='margin-top:14px'>Find out whether Dubai's newcomers <span style='color:var(--lime)'>can find you yet</span></h2> <p class='sub' style='margin:0 auto'>We check your Google Maps visibility in your district, your ads and website in the languages your clients search in, and your clinic ads against DHA rules. Free, with no obligation.</p> <div class='hero-ctas' style='justify-content:center'> <a href='/get-a-free-audit/' class='btn btn-grad'>Request My Dubai Audit</a> <a href='https://wa.me/971588979925' class='btn btn-line'>Message Us on WhatsApp</a> </div> <div class='trust-row'> <span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><rect x='3' y='11' width='18' height='10' rx='2'/><path d='M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4'/></svg>Secure &amp; Private</span> <span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><path d='M18.36 5.64L5.64 18.36M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='6'/></svg>No Spam, Ever</span> <span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><path d='M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-6M12 15V3M8 7l4-4 4 4'/></svg>100% Free</span> </div> </div> </section> </div> 				</div>
